# UI implementation

- Restyle through `src/components/ui/*` (Radix + `cn` + CVA). Do not import raw `@radix-ui/*` in feature views.
- Prefer `Button`, `Label`, `Select`, `Slider`, `Switch`, `Tabs`, `Tooltip`, `Separator`, `Progress`.
- Feature layout lives in `Header`, `DropZone`, `Workspace` — keep pages composing those.
- Transparent image previews use the `.checkerboard` class, not a gray grid.
- Grain overlay stays on `body::before` at z-index 0; `#root` stays `z-index: 1`. Never put a full-page overlay above content.
- Tokens live in `src/index.css` `@theme`. Add colors there, then use `bg-cream-*`, `text-ink`, `font-display`.
- Object URLs: `useObjectUrl` in `src/lib/utils.ts` (Strict Mode safe). Do not `useMemo` + revoke.
- Conversion stays on-device. Do not add upload APIs for source files.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
import * as Slider from '@radix-ui/react-slider'
<Slider.Root className="bg-gray-200" />

// ✅ GOOD
import { Slider } from '@/components/ui/slider'
<Slider min={50} max={100} value={[quality]} onValueChange={...} />
```
